---
import Seo from '../components/Seo.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <Seo title="Not found" description="There is nothing at this address." noindex />
    <style>
      html { background: #0000aa; }
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100svh; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #aaa; font-family: 'Lucida Console', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.3; padding: 24px; }
      .bsod { max-width: 80ch; }
      .t { display: inline-block; background: #aaa; color: #0000aa; padding: 0 8px; margin-bottom: 1.3em; }
      p { margin: 0 0 1.3em; }
      a { color: #fff; }
      .blink { animation: b 1s steps(1) infinite; }
      @keyframes b { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .blink { animation: none; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="bsod">
      <h1 class="t">ajmalroshan.dev</h1>
      <p>A fatal exception 404 has occurred at 0028:C0011E36 in VXD VMM(01) + 00010E36. The current page will be terminated.</p>
      <p>*&nbsp; Press any key to <a href="/">return to the desktop</a>.<br />*&nbsp; Press CTRL+ALT+DEL again to restart your computer. You will lose any unsaved information in all applications.</p>
      <p>The address is wrong, or the page moved when the site did. The <a href="/blog/">notes</a>, the <a href="/projects/">work</a> and the <a href="/now/">system monitor</a> are still where they were.</p>
      <p>Press any key to continue <span class="blink">_</span></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
